WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:09.080
America just needs to wake up and recognize its slave legacy and how it is flourishing from it.

2
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:15.320
This needs to become a core part of who America says it is and own this.

3
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:27.540
Not just be trying to save the rest of the world, but to do whatever it takes to make life livable for those descendants of slaves.

4
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:38.940
And I am a little bit sick of black people being blamed for this idea of “poor choices,” personal choices.

5
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:46.280
Most of us, our ancestors didn’t even choose to come here, and now we’re hearing, “Oh, black people just make poor choices.”

6
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.620
Well, when did these poor choices start?

7
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:54.560
So America needs to get its story straight and really, honestly,

8
00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:04.660
diligently do whatever it can to make sure that all of America has the fullness of what America says it is.

9
00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.500
One nation, indivisible.

10
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.580
And we’re still divided by race.

11
00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:18.760
America has to fix that and stop pointing fingers at people who descended from slaves.

12
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.780
Wrong finger-pointing.

13
00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:26.060
The three fingers that’s pointing back at America are the ones that need to take ownership.

14
00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:34.020
It needs to be at the institutional level, the government level, and all institutions that benefit and flourish.

15
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:43.160
There’s no wealthy person in America that isn’t . . . that doesn’t owe part of its wealth to those who were enslaved.
